cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MadNLP.jl: A nonlinear programming solver in Julia"
message: >-
  If you use MadNLP.jl in your research, please cite the software using
  the metadata in this file. Depending on which parts of MadNLP.jl you
  use, please also consider citing the references listed below.
type: software
